 "summary": "A family of medium-power NPN bipolar transistors in the three-lead SOT-89 surface-mount package, the NPN partners of BCX51, BCX52 and BCX53. BCX54, BCX55 and BCX56 differ in voltage rating (VCEO 45 V, 60 V and 80 V); each comes ungraded (hFE 63 to 250) or in two gain grades, -10 (63 to 160) and -16 (100 to 250). Collector current is rated at 1.0 A and dissipation at 500 mW.",
